izona, Texas, Colorado, Utah, Louisiana, New Mexico, and Washington. It also licenses its brand to restaurants in the Philippines. The company was formerly known as Chicken Acquisition Corp. and changed its name to El Pollo Loco Holdings, Inc. in April 2014. El Pollo Loco Holdings, Inc. was founded in 1975 and is headquartered in Costa Mesa, California.","ceo_bio":"Ms. Elizabeth Goodwin Williams | CEO & Director | Age 49 | Compensation: $1.4M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 4K people. Revenue per employee of $121K ranks in the bottom quartile among Consumer Cyclical peers. Each employee generates $6K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $1K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 11\u00d7 revenue per employee (reasonable relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (5/10).","financial_summary":["El Pollo Loco Holdings, Inc. is a small-cap consumer cyclical business with a $453M market cap on $490M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +1% over the past three years and +3% annually across the full decade, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at 9% against a 8% cost of capital, which means the business barely earns its keep economically.","The business throws off $25M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 5 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 1.82\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.8\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage runs at 9.4\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 0.2%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 2.4% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 7.1% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $10.3M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Significant goodwill (41% of assets) from past acquisitions \u2014 a soft asset a conservative appraisal discounts to zero","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Consumer Cyclical tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Consumer staples outperforming discretionary, signaling cautious spending","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Brand relevance decay \u2014 shifting consumer preferences and social-media-driven trends can strand inventory and invalidate positioning faster than product cycles can adapt.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Piotroski score 7/9 \u2014 financials improving across profitability, leverage and efficiency","Consumer Cyclical sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Sardar Biglari Offloads 19,153 Shares of El Pollo Loco Over Two Days","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/sardar-biglari-offloads-19153-shares-of-el-pollo-loco-over-two-days","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1794006797.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.296,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"El Pollo Loco: 3 Key Takeaways for Long-Term Investors","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/el-pollo-loco-3-key-111724648.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793963844.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title